OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASingalong is pub's alternative to
OL,4,Aparkrun
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "singalong" in a pub, inspired by a
OL,7,Ffamous running event open to all
OL,8,Fability levels, is set to make its
OL,9,Fdebut.
OL,11,F"PubSing" will be held at The Twa Dogs
OL,12,Fpub in Keswick, Cumbria for the first
OL,13,Ftime on 15 October, with its creator
OL,14,FPaul Stafford saying he wants to create
OL,15,Fa musical equivalent to parkrun for
OL,16,F"anybody who likes singing".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
