OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1791699969
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASingalong is pub's alternative to
OL,4,Aparkrun
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe hopes to see at least 12 people
OL,7,Fattend the event - one shy of the very
OL,8,Ffirst parkrun's 13 participants - and
OL,9,Fcontinue to host it on the first
OL,10,FThursday of every month throughout
OL,11,Fwinter.
OL,13,F"We're going for fun, we're not
OL,14,Fexpecting good singers, we want anybody
OL,15,Fto come along," he said.
